1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Veto infiltrated the Underwater Temple, seeking the magic stone that would help the Eye of the Midnight Sun destroy the Clover Kingdom.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
One by one, Asta and his comrades fell victim to Veto's overwhelming power.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Don't speak such words to me, girl!

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Kahuno!

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Put her down! Do it right now!

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
However, Noelle faced Veto and confronted him with everything she had in order to protect her companions.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
I am Noelle Silva of the Black Bulls!

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
And I'm done standing by and watching while you heard my friends and squadmates!

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Slaughter creation magic!

13
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Sea dragons roar!

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
...

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Auuuuuuuuuuuuuuu!

16
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Aaaaaaaaaa!

17
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Aaaaaaaa!

18
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,000
to My arm!

19
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:31,800
My arm!

20
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,520
How's that?

21
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:38,760
At the time, it appeared that Noelle's attack had defeated Veto.

22
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:42,420
But regrettably, the battle was far from being concluded.

23
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:48,880
You have my gratitude for summoning me, human.

24
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:51,820
Where'd that I come from?

25
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:55,820
Mythical Beast Magic, Noelle Chanesha!

26
00:02:05,620 --> 00:02:06,940
His arm!

27
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,680
Krupek?

28
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:11,040
What now?

29
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:15,320
I'll send for assistance at once.

30
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,660
You two do everything you can to help the injured.

31
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:21,640
What's this?

32
00:02:21,820 --> 00:02:25,600
I'm sensing a dreadful mana emanating from somewhere deep in the ocean.

33
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:26,980
Could that beast have returned?

34
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:31,200
That power couldn't come from a mere beast.

35
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,740
He's something even stronger now.

36
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:35,120
A monster!

37
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:37,500
What?

38
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,000
This can't be good.

39
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,580
I've never felt mana so threatening before.

40
00:02:41,580 --> 00:02:47,740
Curious about Veto's power?

41
00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:48,920
It's incredible.

42
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:52,020
You must be confident to let that divert you.

43
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:53,480
Veto!

44
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:55,400
That's right.

45
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,780
The captain mentioned him.

46
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,440
One of the third eye.

47
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,740
The mightiest in the eye of the midnight sun.

48
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:03,520
To think he's the one who invaded this place.

49
00:03:03,620 --> 00:03:05,380
Contemplating your fate, my dear?

50
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:10,220
Yes, you are destined to wither away right where you stand.

51
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:13,400
Now I'll suck out your delicious magic power.

52
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:15,760
And I'll enjoy every second of it.

53
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:18,960
I hate to disappoint you, but you're done.

54
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,760
My friends are counting on me to join them.

55
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:28,540
He seems different.

56
00:03:29,220 --> 00:03:30,200
More evil.

57
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:35,360
He's like something out of the fairy tales Granny used to tell me when I was a little girl.

58
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:42,160
Once upon a time, long ago, a clan of malicious fiends lived here and haunted our world.

59
00:03:42,620 --> 00:03:46,240
They wanted everything in it, especially the magic to be theirs.

60
00:03:46,460 --> 00:03:49,220
And they would do anything in their power to get it.

61
00:03:49,220 --> 00:03:52,840
The most formidable of fiends turned into a demon.

62
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:58,900
In wielding dark, forbidden spells, he attempted to obliterate all of humankind with his magic.

63
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:05,140
The one man who stood up to fight this wickedness went on to become our very first wizard king.

64
00:04:05,940 --> 00:04:07,280
This creature's like them.

65
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:10,340
The greedy fiends Grandmother told me about in this story.

66
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:13,840
Now be gone, mythical beast magic.

